+| Batch | Scope | Tests | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | three real domain implementations | 12 green | landed |
+| 3 | 5 real domains | 29 green | landed |
+| 4 | energy scheduling, demand forecast, retry mesh | 21 green | landed |
+| 5 | planner, zero-downtime migration, risk predictor | 19 green | landed |
+| 6 | traffic control, webhook network | 17 green | landed |
+| — | remaining clones | — | **not started** |
+
+**Honest status: the large majority of the 228 clones are still clones.** The
+batches above converted a small number of packages; the rest still contain the
+generic runtime. Do not describe the estate as "228 real systems" until the
+remaining batches land. The per-package specification below is what each one
+should become, and it is a specification to build against — not a description
+of what is currently there.
